# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the Debug (ENABLE_SANITIZERS=ON) app.
#
# Only third-party leaks belong here — never our own. The app's objects are the
# only instrumented ones, so a leak reported from our code is real and must be
# fixed, not listed below.
#
# libdbus: SDL3 talks to D-Bus (screensaver inhibit, portals) through a
# connection it never tears down, so the session bus registration and its
# message loader stay allocated at exit. ~21 KB in ~9 blocks, constant per run.
# Used by build_and_run.py via LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=scripts/lsan.supp.
leak:libdbus-1
leak:dbus_
